{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2022-02-28 06:45:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ENTERS INTO AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE ORCHID UNDERWRITERS AGENCY AND CROSSCOVER INSURANCE SERVICES', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., FEB. 28, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND THE OWNERSHIP TEAM OF ORCHID UNDERWRITERS AGENCY (“ORCHID”) AND CROSSCOVER INSURANCE SERVICES (“CROSSCOVER”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BROWN & BROWN, INC. (BROWN & BROWN) HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE ORCHID AND CROSSCOVER. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE BEFORE APRIL 2022, SUBJECT TO CERTAIN CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}